  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The same wet floor can reflect in three ways. A probe: everything around it, captured from one point, blurred and often misplaced. SSR: sharp and in place, but only what is on the screen. A planar reflection: sharp and complete, but for one flat surface, at the cost of a second render.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Which of the three shows the lamp posts sharp and in the right place, wherever the camera looks?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Probe: Planar Reflection off, SSR Mode Disabled, the Reflection Probe on.\n2. SSR: the probe off, Mode Opaques Only.\n3. Planar: Mode Disabled, Planar Reflection on.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reflections 1\u20134</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
