  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Screen Space Reflections (SSR) find each reflection in the picture that is already drawn. They are sharp and in the right place, but they can show only what is on the screen: what is off-screen or hidden reflects nothing. In VR each eye sees a different picture, so SSR may differ between the eyes.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> SSR is on. You tilt the camera down until the lamp leaves the top of the picture. What happens to its reflection in the floor?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Reflections Volume (global) and set Screen Space Reflection \u203A Mode to Opaques Only.\n2. Tilt this camera down slowly and watch the lamp's reflection.\n3. Set Mode back to Disabled.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reflections 5 (the three compared) \xB7 Reference 17</color></size>"
