      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A wet floor looks wet only by what it reflects. Its smoothness makes it a mirror, and a mirror shows only what is around it. In an empty, dark place a wet floor looks like a dark, dry one. Lights, signs and lit windows nearby make it read as wet.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Floors A and B use the same wet material. Which one looks wet?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Copy the neon sign from B into A.\n2. Select A's Reflection Probe and press Bake.\n3. Compare the two floors again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 17 \xB7 Materials-Training 6 \xB7 Reflections</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
